[PrintTextModified Text:――監獄生活２周目、１１日目。|#0202Adv02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:――私は魔女を殺す。|#0202Adv02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:――殺す。殺す。殺す。殺す。<br>殺す殺す殺す殺す殺す殺す殺す殺す殺す|#0202Adv02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

